{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_06962","headline":"故绦行 · 杜頠","name":"故绦行","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"君不见铜鞮观，数里城池已芜漫。\n君不见虒祁宫，几重台榭亦微蒙。\n介马兵车全盛时，歌童舞女妖艳姿。\n一代繁华皆共绝，九原唯望冢累累。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"杜頠","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_06962.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_06962","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}